th powerful engines, tires, and other enhancements. Personalize your car\u2019s appearance with custom paint jobs and decals.\n\nStunning Graphics and Realistic Physics: Enjoy high-quality graphics that bring the racing world to life. Experience realistic car physics that provide a true-to-life driving experience. Race through beautifully designed environments and dynamic weather conditions.\n\nEasy Controls: Intuitive controls designed for smooth and responsive gameplay.", "short_description": "Step into high-speed Formula racing in VR. Drive open-wheel race cars, sit inside a fully immersive cockpit, and compete on professional-style circuits. Feel realistic handling, intense speed, and competitive Formula-style racing built exclusively for Pro racing lovers."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/namigamesstudio/privacy-policy/meta-quest-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Nami Games Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/namigamesstudio/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "673385183287495"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25731430113173093"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1913523346191830"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1823787785000836"}]}, "baseline_offe